== index.html
<main id="text">
<h1 id="proj">Proj</h1>
<p>A tiny book. Start with <a href="first.html">the first steps</a>, then <a href="files.html#reading">files</a>, and <a href="math.html">formulas</a>, and the <a href="ref/index.html">reference</a>.</p>
<pre><code class="cesia"><span class="k">use</span> std/io
io.<span class="f">Print</span>(<span class="s">&quot;home&quot;</span>)</code></pre>
<pre class="output"><code>home</code></pre>
<nav class="pager" aria-label="Pages"><span></span><span></span><a rel="next" href="first.html">First steps →</a></nav>
</main>
== first.html
<main id="text">
<nav class="trail" aria-label="Where"><a href="index.html">Book</a> <span aria-hidden="true">›</span> <span>First steps</span></nav>
<h1 id="first-steps">First steps</h1>
<p>Names and <a href="ref/std/value/Len.html">value.Len</a>:</p>
<pre><code class="cesia"><span class="k">use</span> src/greet
<span class="k">use</span> std/io
<span class="k">use</span> std/math
<span class="k">use</span> std/value
x = <span class="m">2</span> + <span class="m">3</span>
x --&gt; <span class="m">5</span>
x * <span class="m">2</span> --&gt; <span class="m">10</span>
io.<span class="f">Print</span>(greet.<span class="f">Hello</span>(<span class="s">&quot;Ana&quot;</span>))
value.<span class="f">Len</span>(<span class="s">&quot;abc&quot;</span>) --&gt; <span class="m">3</span></code></pre>
<pre class="output"><code>Hello, Ana!</code></pre>
<p>A value with a line end:</p>
<pre><code class="cesia"><span class="s">&quot;a\nb&quot;</span> --&gt; <span class="s">&quot;a</span>
<span class="s">b&quot;</span></code></pre>
<p>This one stops:</p>
<pre><code class="cesia">math.<span class="f">Div</span>(x, <span class="m">0</span>)</code></pre>
<pre class="output"><code>Div: division by zero.</code></pre>
<p>Not run:</p>
<pre><code class="cesia"><span class="k">use</span> std/http
http.<span class="f">Fetch</span>(<span class="s">&quot;https://example.com&quot;</span>)</code></pre>
<p>A table made by code:</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>a</th>
<th>b</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td>2</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<pre><code class="cesia"><span class="k">for</span> k <span class="k">in</span> <span class="m">1</span>..<span class="m">3</span>
  io.<span class="f">Print</span>(k)
<span class="k">end</span></code></pre>
<details><summary>Output</summary>
<pre class="output"><code>1
2
3</code></pre>
</details>
<pre><code class="language-toml">[project]
name = &quot;x&quot;
</code></pre>
<nav class="pager" aria-label="Pages"><a rel="prev" href="index.html">← Proj</a><a rel="up" href="index.html">Proj</a><a rel="next" href="files.html">Files →</a></nav>
</main>
== files.html
<main id="text">
<nav class="trail" aria-label="Where"><a href="index.html">Book</a> <span aria-hidden="true">›</span> <span>Files</span></nav>
<h1 id="files">Files</h1>
<h2 id="reading">Reading</h2>
<pre><code class="cesia"><span class="k">use</span> std/sys
<span class="k">use</span> std/fiber
<span class="k">use</span> std/io
io.<span class="f">Print</span>(sys.<span class="f">Read</span>(<span class="s">&quot;notes.txt&quot;</span>).<span class="f">Value</span>)</code></pre>
<p class="allow">Runs with <code>--allow read</code></p>
<pre class="output"><code>first line
second line
</code></pre>
<p>A block that stops can repeat a use of the page:</p>
<pre><code class="cesia"><span class="k">use</span> std/sys
sys.<span class="f">Write</span>(<span class="s">&quot;notes.txt&quot;</span>, <span class="s">&quot;no&quot;</span>)</code></pre>
<pre class="output"><code>Permission &quot;write&quot; denied for notes.txt.
Run again with --allow write=notes.txt, or a folder that holds it.</code></pre>
<p>A server and its client, on this machine only:</p>
<pre><code class="cesia"><span class="k">use</span> std/http
app = http.<span class="f">App</span>() <span class="k">then</span> http.<span class="f">Get</span>(<span class="s">&quot;/&quot;</span>, r -&gt; http.<span class="f">Plain</span>(<span class="s">&quot;hello&quot;</span>), <span class="k">it</span>)
server = fiber.<span class="f">Spawn</span>(() -&gt; http.<span class="f">Serve</span>(app, port = <span class="m">18751</span>))
sys.<span class="f">Sleep</span>(<span class="m">0.05</span>)
http.<span class="f">Fetch</span>(<span class="s">&quot;http://127.0.0.1:18751/&quot;</span>).<span class="f">Value</span>.<span class="f">Body</span> --&gt; <span class="s">&quot;hello&quot;</span></code></pre>
<p class="allow">Runs with <code>--allow net=127.0.0.1,net=:18751</code></p>
<p>A --&gt; in a comment or a text is no check of the book:</p>
<pre><code class="cesia"><span class="k">defn</span> <span class="n">twice</span>(x)
  <span class="c">(** Twice x.</span>

<span class="c">        twice(2) --&gt; 5 *)</span>
  x * <span class="m">2</span>
<span class="k">end</span>
<span class="s">&quot;a --&gt; b&quot;</span> --&gt; <span class="s">&quot;a --&gt; b&quot;</span></code></pre>
<p>Back to <a href="index.html">the start</a>.</p>
<nav class="pager" aria-label="Pages"><a rel="prev" href="first.html">← First steps</a><a rel="up" href="index.html">Proj</a><a rel="next" href="math.html">Formulas and colors →</a></nav>
</main>
