== formulas, GitHub's alerts and a table, in the colors of the project, and the font of formulas with its licence
<main id="text">
<nav class="trail" aria-label="Where"><a href="index.html">Book</a> <span aria-hidden="true">›</span> <span>Formulas and colors</span></nav>
<h1 id="formulas-and-colors">Formulas and colors</h1>
<p>In a line: <math><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mspace width="0.1667em"></mspace><mi>log</mi><mspace width="0.1667em"></mspace><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, <math><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>31</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, <math><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math>, <math><mo>⌈</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0" rspace="0">/</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>⌉</mo></math>, <math><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0" rspace="0">/</mo><mi>W</mi></math>, <math><mi mathvariant="normal">Θ</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></math>,
<math><mn>1,000</mn><mo lspace="0" rspace="0">/</mo><mn>36,200</mn><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><mtext>s</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>27.6</mn><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><mtext>ms</mtext></math>, <math><mi>𝑣𝑙𝑜</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>j</mi></math>, <math><mo>(</mo><mtext>view</mtext><mo>,</mo><msup><mtext>delta</mtext><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>)</mo></math>, <math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>.</p>
<math display="block"><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∋</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mo lspace="0" rspace="0">|</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0" rspace="0">|</mo><mo>≤</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mo lspace="0" rspace="0">|</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msup><mo lspace="0" rspace="0">|</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msup><mo>,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mtext>a collision</mtext><mo>)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow></msup></math>
<p>A price stays text, it costs $5 and $6, and code too: <code>$x$</code>.</p>
<div class="alert note">
<p class="alert-title">Note</p>
<p>A note, with a formula: <math><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.</p>
</div>
<div class="alert warning">
<p class="alert-title">Warning</p>
<p>A warning.</p>
</div>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Size</th>
<th>Cost</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>small</td>
<td><math><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>large</td>
<td><code>slow</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>huge</td>
<td><math><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></math></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2 id="whats-new"><span id="what-s-new"></span>What's new?</h2>
<p>A heading whose id GitHub makes otherwise than the site did keeps the old one too.</p>
