== the README, a page made from README.md, in the side of every page
<main id="text">
<h1 id="proj">Proj</h1>
<p>A tiny project with <a href="index.html">a book</a>, its <a href="first.html#first-steps">first steps</a> and
<a href="guides/index.html">guides</a>. A formula: <math><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.</p>
<div class="alert tip">
<p class="alert-title">Tip</p>
<p>The site shows this page as its README.</p>
</div>
<pre><code class="cesia"><span class="k">use</span> std/http
http.<span class="f">Serve</span>(http.<span class="f">App</span>(), port = <span class="m">8080</span>)</code></pre>
</main>
